# Styling

See `docs/design-system.md` for the full system.

- Define colors, fonts, radii and motion as tokens in `src/styles/globals.css`.
- Compose classes with `cn()` from `src/lib/cn`.
- Use the Shoreline colour utilities (`bg-bg`, `text-body`, `text-muted`, `border-line`, `text-accent`), never hex values.
- Use type roles for text (`type-display`, `type-title`, `type-lead`, `type-small`, `type-label`, `type-meta`) plus a color utility.
- Use `WaveRule` instead of borders or `<hr>`, and `PageColumns` for page bodies with margin notes.

```tsx
// BAD
<p className="font-mono text-[11px] text-[#a1a1aa]" />

// GOOD
<p className={cn("type-meta text-muted", className)} />
```
